          ]
        }
      },
      "commentary": "If West follows low on the first diamond play, an honour should be played from the dummy. In this case, South must now hope that diamonds are 3-2. After the ♦A is forced out, the ♥K will act as an entry to the established diamonds."
    }
  ]
}
